---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Analysis on scientific writing, peer review and biotech communication.
---
<div class="panel bg-down" style="display:block;">
  <div class="panel-inner">

    <div class="eyebrow">Blog</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(34px,5.2vw,62px)">Where scientific communication breaks down — and how to fix it</h1>
    <p class="lede">Analysis on scientific writing, peer review and biotech communication, from the team behind Iridis.</p>

    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="blog-card-link" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <article class="blog-card">
          {% if post.data.cover %}
          <div class="blog-head" style="background-image:url('{{ post.data.cover }}'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;"></div>
          {% else %}
          <div class="blog-head"><span class="tag">{{ post.data.tags[0] }}</span></div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="blog-body">
            <div class="blog-meta">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.readingTime %} · {{ post.data.readingTime }} min{% endif %}</div>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if collections.posts.length == 0 %}
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:var(--sp-8)">No posts yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</div>
